---
/// Tutorial fuck-ups are triggered by unexpected actions made by the player during the tutorial, decribed at the beginning of each fuck-up node. They don't disturb the flow of tutorial steps

/// The player throws something

<<once>>
    Narrador: Jeje, sí.
    Narrador: Con eso mandas las cosas a volar.
    Narrador: Podría servirte para algo, creo.
<<endonce>>

<<jump TutorialFuckUpReroute>>

===

